{"id":3873,"date":"2025-05-25T11:11:49","date_gmt":"2025-05-25T11:11:49","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/?p=3873"},"modified":"2025-08-11T04:53:38","modified_gmt":"2025-08-11T04:53:38","slug":"dich-vu-quang-cao-tiktok-ads","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/kien-thuc-tiktok\/dich-vu-quang-cao-tiktok-ads\/","title":{"rendered":"D\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o TikTok Ads t\u0103ng tr\u01b0\u1edfng s\u1ed1, t\u0103ng nh\u1eadn di\u1ec7n"},"content":{"rendered":"<div data-page-id=\"QZlidIqtUoBSrwxUeCwlXutRgV7\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I9skdweOOoyxtYx7Ya9lmk0hgQb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">TikTok \u0111ang t\u1ea1o d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n tr\u00ean th\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1eddng v\u00e0 l\u00e0 \u201cm\u1ea3nh \u0111\u1ea5t v\u00e0ng\u201d gi\u00fap h\u00e0ng lo\u1ea1t doanh nghi\u1ec7p nh\u1ecf l\u1ebb t\u0103ng tr\u01b0\u1edfng doanh thu. Tuy nhi\u00ean, kh\u00f4ng ph\u1ea3i ai c\u0169ng bi\u1ebft c\u00e1ch t\u1eadn d\u1ee5ng n\u00f3 hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3. \u0110\u00f3 l\u00e0 l\u00fd do v\u00ec sao n\u00ean s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o TikTok Ads v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ec3 t\u00ecm hi\u1ec3u b\u00ed quy\u1ebft gi\u00fap t\u0103ng tr\u01b0\u1edfng s\u1ed1, t\u0103ng nh\u1eadn di\u1ec7n. H\u00e3y c\u00f9ng <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\">Lemon Digital<\/a><\/strong>\u00a0 t\u00ecm hi\u1ec3u n\u1ed9i dung b\u00ean d\u01b0\u1edbi.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-M4sudRHVVo5eERxZtVylloWHgKg\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;887b2d7b-fce6-4440-a09a-db5e0f78a066&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:546.6666666666666,&quot;width&quot;:819.9999999999999,&quot;currHeight&quot;:546.6666666666666,&quot;currWidth&quot;:819.9999999999999,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:490,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:735,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1.1156462585034013,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FF4vIbkaTLoVsOxxfu51lSNbHgPh%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;F4vIbkaTLoVsOxxfu51lSNbHgPh&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:501799,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_3899\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-3899\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-3899\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/4.png\" alt=\"Ch\u1ea1y qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o TikTok Ads l\u00e0 g\u00ec\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/4.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/4-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/4-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/4-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/4-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-3899\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Ch\u1ea1y qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o TikTok Ads l\u00e0 g\u00ec<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WXh4dOXNeo3fkuxf70SlMYnwgEg\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"QZlidIqtUoBSrwxUeCwlXutRgV7\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-S3BYdXbatoBSSrx4b6VljobCgXe\">Ch\u1ea1y qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o TikTok Ads l\u00e0 g\u00ec?<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I4nHdwDCRo0lB4xwYrblRguTg5A\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">TikTok Ads l\u00e0 n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o do TikTok ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n nh\u1eb1m, h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 c\u00e1c doanh nghi\u1ec7p v\u00e0 c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch qu\u1ea3ng b\u00e1 tr\u00ean \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng. \u0110\u1ec3 n\u00f3i m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n l\u00e0 b\u1ea1n d\u00f9ng ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n \u0111\u1ec3 chi ti\u00eau cho vi\u1ec7c qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o nh\u1eefng th\u00f4ng \u0111i\u1ec7p m\u00e0 b\u1ea1n mu\u1ed1n hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb \u0111\u1ebfn kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng ti\u1ec1m n\u0103ng c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 l\u00e0 v\u1ec1 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m, d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5, th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u ho\u1eb7c h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n mu\u1ed1n x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng. C\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 n\u00e0y gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn \u0111\u00f4ng \u0111\u1ea3o \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng ti\u1ec1m n\u0103ng v\u1edbi nhi\u1ec1u h\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o \u0111a d\u1ea1ng.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q1BYdVPGLo3lLXxDb50lxsrogVg\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-OYJmdZOk1oldJmxfo5KlI8Qngfe\">V\u00ec sao doanh nghi\u1ec7p n\u00ean ch\u1ea1y qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o TikTok?<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Qd9XdVmz2oikFKxYOWLlZQIAgCf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"QZlidIqtUoBSrwxUeCwlXutRgV7\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_3900\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-3900\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-3900\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/5.png\" alt=\"TikTok Ads h\u1ecdc h\u1ecfi \u0111\u1ec3 th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng.\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/5.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/5-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/5-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/5-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/5-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-3900\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">TikTok Ads h\u1ecdc h\u1ecfi \u0111\u1ec3 th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng.<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-Iy27dkEaZoHWvPx0CESlLVpmgth\">Ti\u1ebft ki\u1ec7m th\u1eddi gian, chi ph\u00ed<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QnvVdj8QEo1hrmxH4qtlEciggwh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u201cTh\u1eddi gian l\u00e0 v\u00e0ng l\u00e0 b\u1ea1c\u201d \u2013 c\u00e2u n\u00f3i c\u1ee7a \u00f4ng b\u00e0 ta ng\u00e0y x\u01b0a v\u1eabn ho\u00e0n to\u00e0n \u0111\u00fang trong th\u1eddi \u0111\u1ea1i s\u1ed1. Vi\u1ec7c ch\u1ea1y qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o tr\u00ean TikTok kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 gi\u00fap doanh nghi\u1ec7p ti\u1ebft ki\u1ec7m th\u1eddi gian v\u00e0 chi ph\u00ed, m\u00e0 c\u00f2n mang l\u1ea1i hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 v\u01b0\u1ee3t tr\u1ed9i trong vi\u1ec7c ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng. Nh\u1edd \u0111\u00f3, TikTok \u0111ang tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh s\u1ef1 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn h\u1ea5p d\u1eabn cho c\u00e1c doanh nghi\u1ec7p mu\u1ed1n t\u1ed1i \u01b0u h\u00f3a ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch v\u00e0 gia t\u0103ng doanh thu m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch nhanh ch\u00f3ng.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SLvBdCAwOoGuejx2WLNloUOggWc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">TikTok l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t trong nh\u1eefng n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng c\u00f3 chi ph\u00ed qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o th\u1ea5p h\u01a1n t\u00ednh tr\u00ean m\u1ed7i l\u01b0\u1ee3t hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb (CPM) ho\u1eb7c m\u1ed7i l\u01b0\u1ee3t nh\u1ea5p chu\u1ed9t (CPC), \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi c\u00e1c s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m, d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 h\u01b0\u1edbng \u0111\u1ebfn nh\u00f3m kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng tr\u1ebb v\u00e0 ti\u1ec1m n\u0103ng. Nh\u1edd kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng ph\u00e2n ph\u1ed1i n\u1ed9i dung th\u00f4ng minh, TikTok gi\u00fap doanh nghi\u1ec7p ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn \u0111\u00fang \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng quan t\u00e2m, d\u1eabn h\u1ecd v\u1ec1 c\u00e1c trang b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng nh\u01b0 website, Shopee, Lazada,\u2026 t\u1eeb \u0111\u00f3 gia t\u0103ng c\u01a1 h\u1ed9i ch\u1ed1t \u0111\u01a1n v\u00e0 th\u00fac \u0111\u1ea9y doanh thu hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LT3hdHQjfoGLd2xaCFIl4unQgNQ\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">TikTok cung c\u1ea5p hai h\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch ch\u00ednh cho nh\u00e0 qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o g\u1ed3m: T\u1ed5ng ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch (Lifetime Budget) v\u00e0 Ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch h\u1eb1ng ng\u00e0y (Daily Budget).<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-U05UdWK4do6JjDx1YaklQlF3ggU\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Trong \u0111\u00f3, chi ph\u00ed t\u1ed1i thi\u1ec3u \u0111\u1ec3 b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u ch\u1ea1y qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng n\u00e0y l\u00e0 200.000 VN\u0110\/ng\u00e0y. M\u1ee9c ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch n\u00e0y ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 c\u00e1c doanh nghi\u1ec7p nh\u1ecf ho\u1eb7c ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n m\u1edbi th\u1eed nghi\u1ec7m hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi \u0111\u1ea7u t\u01b0 quy m\u00f4 l\u1edbn h\u01a1n.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-DnbzdLYEyoxuGOxONo2lLR6mgdh\">Ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng nhanh ch\u00f3ng qua video<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Je5id2DTVo8yoExZGstlQ1mwgSd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng nhanh ch\u00f3ng qua video l\u00e0 l\u1ee3i th\u1ebf l\u1edbn c\u1ee7a TikTok. Nh\u1edd n\u1ed9i dung ng\u1eafn, b\u1eaft trend v\u00e0 d\u1ec5 lan truy\u1ec1n, video tr\u00ean TikTok gi\u00fap doanh nghi\u1ec7p thu h\u00fat s\u1ef1 ch\u00fa \u00fd ch\u1ec9 trong v\u00e0i gi\u00e2y, t\u1eeb \u0111\u00f3 gia t\u0103ng nh\u1eadn di\u1ec7n th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u v\u00e0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi ti\u00eau d\u00f9ng c\u0169ng nhanh ch\u00f3ng ch\u1ecdn l\u1ecdc \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c nhu c\u1ea7u c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh nhanh ch\u00f3ng h\u01a1n. V\u1edbi h\u01a1n 1 t\u1ef7 ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng tr\u00ean to\u00e0n c\u1ea7u, TikTok \u0111ang thu h\u00fat ph\u1ea7n l\u1edbn nh\u00f3m Gen Z v\u00e0 Millennials. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 nh\u1eefng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau ch\u00ednh c\u00f3 s\u1ee9c mua m\u1ea1nh m\u1ebd v\u00e0 lu\u00f4n \u0111\u00f3n \u0111\u1ea7u c\u00e1c xu h\u01b0\u1edbng m\u1edbi.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-W6jmdNyUroPUcDxdWaBlZstPgOc\">T\u0103ng t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i v\u00e0 doanh thu b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-USs9dcN8Uovbu0xJ7nolKahVgRd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">M\u1ed9t trong nh\u1eefng \u0111i\u1ec3m n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt c\u1ee7a TikTok Shop l\u00e0 ch\u1ec9 m\u1ed9t video b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng ch\u1ec9 trong v\u00e0i gi\u00e2y n\u1ebfu \u0111\u1ee7 thu h\u00fat, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 b\u1ea5m mua h\u00e0ng ngay ch\u1ec9 trong v\u00e0i thao t\u00e1c nh\u1ea5p v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng b\u1ebfn g\u00f3c tr\u00e1i. Vi\u1ec7c l\u00e0m n\u00e0y gi\u00fap r\u00fat ng\u1eafn qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh mua s\u1eafm, t\u1eeb \u0111\u00f3 t\u0103ng \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 t\u1ed1i \u01b0u h\u00f3a chi ph\u00ed qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o ch\u1ec9 v\u1edbi v\u00e0i gi\u00e2y xem video,<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XZZCdlJvvoWpgIxUHlWldm5vgVe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Nh\u1edd kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng li\u00ean k\u1ebft tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp v\u1edbi landing page, TikTok Shop v\u00e0 trang b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng t\u1eeb \u0111\u00f3 m\u00e0 t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i c\u0169ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u1ed1i \u01b0u l\u00ean m\u1ee9c t\u1ed1i \u0111a. B\u00ean c\u1ea1nh \u0111\u00f3, chi ph\u00ed m\u1ed7i l\u01b0\u1ee3t nh\u1ea5p (CPC) r\u1ea5t th\u1ea5p gi\u00fap doanh nghi\u1ec7p ti\u1ebft ki\u1ec7m ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o m\u00e0 v\u1eabn ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn \u0111\u00fang kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng, t\u0103ng \u0111\u01a1n hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-LvbBdORuqoqXuLxHItQlPTsIgfd\">Ch\u1ec9 s\u1ed1 \u0111o l\u01b0\u1eddng minh b\u1ea1ch, r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QItrdj8Q5oVUTCxUtTElWpqDguh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t trong nh\u1eefng \u01b0u \u0111i\u1ec3m c\u1ee7a n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng n\u00e0y. Vi\u1ec7c kinh doanh thuth l\u1ee3i c\u1ea7n c\u00f3 c\u00e1c th\u00f4ng s\u1ed1 chi ti\u1ebft c\u00e1c ch\u1ec9 s\u1ed1 nh\u01b0: l\u01b0\u1ee3t hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb, l\u01b0\u1ee3t nh\u1ea5p (CTR), t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i, chi ph\u00ed\/hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 (CPA, ROAS),\u2026 gi\u00fap doanh nghi\u1ec7p d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng theo d\u00f5i, \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch v\u00e0 \u0111i\u1ec1u ch\u1ec9nh k\u1ecbp th\u1eddi \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u1ea1t m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau \u0111\u1ec1 ra.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-YphVd7mDlolZo7xU2JSlDTtSgad\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;8f0137da-5aa4-4398-a71f-2060b0a21745&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:610.4099616858238,&quot;width&quot;:509,&quot;currHeight&quot;:610.4099616858238,&quot;currWidth&quot;:509,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:626,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:522,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:0.975095785440613,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FLTorbJHrHomapKx5XVllKSt4gnf%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;LTorbJHrHomapKx5XVllKSt4gnf&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:184052,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_3901\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-3901\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-3901\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/6.png\" alt=\"C\u00e1c ch\u1ec9 s\u1ed1 t\u1eeb TikTok\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/6.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/6-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/6-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/6-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/6-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-3901\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">C\u00e1c ch\u1ec9 s\u1ed1 t\u1eeb TikTok<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LI90do4ZWoviPWxM5cMlbFnbg2c\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-TCmqdakfIomb9ExGpIIlfykrg5f\">C\u00e1c h\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c ch\u1ea1y qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o TikTok ph\u1ed5 bi\u1ebfn<\/h2>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-UV1rdDVQGo5zbexhUn4l8r9dgJg\">In-Feed Video Ads<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MF58dMxruohkL7xEjsqlDxVwgjc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 d\u1ea1ng video qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o ng\u1eafn (5\u201360 gi\u00e2y) xu\u1ea5t hi\u1ec7n xen k\u1ebd trong l\u00fac ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng l\u01b0\u1edbt TikTok \u1edf m\u1ee5c &#8220;D\u00e0nh cho b\u1ea1n&#8221; (For You Page).<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EKrydWxKAojzZ9xeP21lW0Magnc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Theo TikTok For Business, In-Feed Ads c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 \u0111\u1ea1t t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 nh\u1ea5p (CTR) trung b\u00ecnh 1.5% \u2013 2.2% v\u00e0 t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 ho\u00e0n th\u00e0nh video (VTR) tr\u00ean 60% n\u1ebfu n\u1ed9i dung \u0111\u1ee7 thu h\u00fat. \u0110\u1ecbnh d\u1ea1ng n\u00e0y ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u1ea9y \u0111\u01a1n tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp v\u00e0 d\u1ec5 g\u1eafn c\u00e1c n\u00fat k\u00eau g\u1ecdi h\u00e0nh \u0111\u1ed9ng nh\u01b0 \u201cMua ngay\u201d, \u201cXem th\u00eam\u201d, \u201c\u0110\u1eb7t h\u00e0ng\u201d.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-S3A9ds0f1oZnBIx3jvKlsoLVgZf\">Brand Takeover<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BaVPdLfitoQsoJxsqwflex7sg5e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">L\u00e0 lo\u1ea1i qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb to\u00e0n m\u00e0n h\u00ecnh khi ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng m\u1edf TikTok, k\u00e9o d\u00e0i t\u1eeb 3\u20135 gi\u00e2y, kh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 b\u1ecf qua. Theo th\u1ed1ng k\u00ea t\u1eeb TikTok, lo\u1ea1i qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o n\u00e0y c\u00f3 t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb g\u1ea7n nh\u01b0 tuy\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ed1i (100%) v\u00e0 CTR trung b\u00ecnh l\u00ean t\u1edbi 16%. C\u00e1c th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u l\u1edbn nh\u01b0 Guess, Nike, Biti\u2019s t\u1eebng s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o \u1ea5n t\u01b0\u1ee3ng m\u1ea1nh v\u00e0 nhanh ch\u00f3ng t\u0103ng nh\u1eadn di\u1ec7n th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-TCvcdu8PAoKTmgx7gxXle6Oegrg\">Hashtag Challenge<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NUoodjePAoPBygx28SOlRXFzgPh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch khuy\u1ebfn kh\u00edch ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng t\u1ea1o video theo m\u1ed9t ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec1 c\u1ee5 th\u1ec3 k\u00e8m hashtag. Theo TikTok, Hashtag Challenge gi\u00fap t\u0103ng g\u1ea5p 8,5 l\u1ea7n m\u1ee9c \u0111\u1ed9 t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c so v\u1edbi h\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o truy\u1ec1n th\u1ed1ng. C\u00e1c chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch th\u01b0\u1eddng ch\u1ea1y 3\u20136 ng\u00e0y \u0111\u1ec3 viral, sau \u0111\u00f3 m\u1edf r\u1ed9ng t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LUG5dAr2WoFgcrxpi5llwV2Ygie\">\n<div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">V\u00ed d\u1ee5: #GucciModelChallenge thu h\u00fat h\u01a1n 2,2 tri\u1ec7u video, gi\u00fap Gucci t\u0103ng l\u01b0\u1ee3ng t\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm h\u01a1n 30%.<\/div>\n<div>\n<div class=\"ace-line text-indent ace-line old-record-id-LAr7duEV7oUZPDxZ7AXl0fULgMe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0\u00a0#PepsiChallenge t\u1ea1i Vi\u1ec7t Nam thu h\u00fat h\u01a1n 150 tri\u1ec7u l\u01b0\u1ee3t xem ch\u1ec9 sau 7 ng\u00e0y.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-PuUOdUIpHolK7bxegbZlsvhTgPe\">Effect House<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C1bAdRZAxoObuixSJcKlZxuQgUb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">M\u1ed9t trong nh\u1eefng c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 gi\u00fap c\u00e1c th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 t\u1ef1 t\u1ea1o cho ri\u00eang m\u00ecnh m\u1ed9t hi\u1ec7u \u1ee9ng ho\u1eb7c m\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch tuy\u00ean truy\u1ec1n. V\u00ed d\u1ee5 nh\u01b0 nh\u1eefng filter beauty, game, test s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m online,&#8230; Kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n \u0111\u1ebfn c\u1eeda h\u00e0ng nh\u01b0ng v\u1eabn c\u00f3 tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m \u201cd\u00f9ng th\u1eed\u201d s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m th\u00f4ng qua 1 chi\u1ebfc qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o r\u1ea5t \u0111\u00e1ng \u0111\u1ea7u t\u01b0.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ItWVd7Cpjoiuo1xfw61llQeggBh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Theo TikTok, 63% ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng cho bi\u1ebft h\u1ecd \u01b0a th\u00edch v\u00e0 d\u1ec5 ghi nh\u1edb th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u c\u00f3 filter \u0111\u1ed9c quy\u1ec1n. \u0110i\u1ec3n h\u00ecnh nh\u01b0 vi\u1ec7c Maybelline s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng filter th\u1eed son \u1ea3o gi\u00fap t\u0103ng t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 click mua h\u00e0ng l\u00ean 41%.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_3906\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-3906\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-3906\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/so-1-Lemonn.-vn-6.png\" alt=\" C\u00e1c h\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c ch\u1ea1y qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o TikTok ph\u1ed5 bi\u1ebfn\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/so-1-Lemonn.-vn-6.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/so-1-Lemonn.-vn-6-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/so-1-Lemonn.-vn-6-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/so-1-Lemonn.-vn-6-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/so-1-Lemonn.-vn-6-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-3906\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">C\u00e1c h\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c ch\u1ea1y qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o TikTok ph\u1ed5 bi\u1ebfn<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TmrodVnQnorDcXxCRJ9lbAUQgcc\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-CGhldInuyoXl1GxbBNFl10yfg4f\">\u0110\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p ch\u1ea1y TikTok Ads<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HohXdnmy7ormTkxhM8rlbQDQgae\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u0110\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p ch\u1ea1y TikTok Ads l\u00e0 nh\u1eefng c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n, t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c ho\u1eb7c doanh nghi\u1ec7p c\u00f3 m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau qu\u1ea3ng b\u00e1 th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u, s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ho\u1eb7c d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-DRWRdr2SOoCpgAxeMaplhDJagng\">C\u00e1c nh\u00e3n h\u00e0ng l\u1edbn<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BZPZdrx21ohbh9xZAptl6MntgSb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">V\u1edbi m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau t\u0103ng nh\u1eadn di\u1ec7n th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u, t\u1ea1o viral, ra m\u1eaft s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m m\u1edbi,&#8230; C\u00e1c &#8220;g\u00e3 kh\u1ed5ng l\u1ed3&#8221; s\u1ebd lu\u00f4n t\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm cho m\u00ecnh m\u1ed9t \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c uy t\u00edn \u2013 ng\u01b0\u1eddi c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 c\u00f9ng h\u1ecd ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n m\u1ea1nh m\u1ebd h\u01a1n, t\u1ea1o ra chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o, hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 v\u00e0 d\u1eabn \u0111\u1ea7u xu h\u01b0\u1edbng tr\u00ean TikTok.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-MOiHdDkgDodlxkxzbqelziuwgue\">Doanh nghi\u1ec7p SME<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FN8YdyCJ7oWh8qxqwrkl7sN5gCV\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">T\u00f9y thu\u1ed9c v\u00e0o t\u1eebng lo\u1ea1i h\u00f4 hh\u00ecn v\u00e0 s\u1ee9c \u1ea3nh h\u01b0\u1edfng m\u00e0 doanh nghi\u1ec7p mu\u1ed1n truy\u1ec1n t\u1ea3i. Small and Medium Enterprises (SME), t\u1ee9c l\u00e0 Doanh nghi\u1ec7p nh\u1ecf v\u00e0 v\u1eeba. V\u00ed d\u1ee5 hi\u1ec3u nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t c\u1eeda h\u00e0ng qu\u1ea7n \u00e1o online do 2-3 ng\u01b0\u1eddi v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh ho\u1eb7c m\u1ed9t qu\u00e1n c\u00e0 ph\u00ea nh\u1ecf t\u1ef1 m\u1edf \u0111\u1ec1u l\u00e0 SME. Do quy m\u00f4 nh\u1ecf v\u00e0 ngu\u1ed3n l\u1ef1c h\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf, h\u1ecd th\u01b0\u1eddng kh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 t\u1ef1 m\u00ecnh \u0111\u1ea3m \u0111\u01b0\u01a1ng h\u1ebft m\u1ecdi c\u00f4ng vi\u1ec7c v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh v\u00e0 c\u00e1c ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng marketing chuy\u00ean s\u00e2u V\u00ec v\u1eady vi\u1ec7c l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn h\u1ee3p t\u00e1c c\u00f9ng TikTok Agency l\u00e0 c\u1ea7n thi\u1ebft<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-Du7CdLzBNoTxm4xaggqlcprNgmg\">KOL, KOC, Influencer<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SyW9dUi3volNH2xAWaXlO1ORg3K\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">3 \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng KOL, KOC, Influencer \u0111\u1ec1u l\u00e0 nh\u1eefng chuy\u00ean gia c\u00f3 s\u1ee9c \u1ea3nh h\u01b0\u1edfng. Tuy kh\u00f4ng gi\u1ed1ng nhau v\u1ec1 ph\u1ea1m vi \u1ea3nh h\u01b0\u1edfng nh\u01b0ng h\u1ecd \u0111\u1ec1u l\u00e0 nh\u1eefng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c c\u1ea7n thi\u1ebft. M\u1ed7i KOL\/KOC\/Influencer c\u00f3 nh\u00f3m \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng ng\u01b0\u1eddi theo d\u00f5i ri\u00eang bi\u1ec7t v\u1ec1 \u0111\u1ed9 tu\u1ed5i, s\u1edf th\u00edch, v\u00f9ng mi\u1ec1n,&#8230;\u0111i\u1ec1u n\u00e0y gi\u00fap qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ph\u00e2n ph\u1ed1i \u0111\u1ebfn nh\u00f3m kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng ti\u1ec1m n\u0103ng. M\u1ee9c \u0111\u1ed9 \u1ea3nh h\u01b0\u1edfng kh\u00f4ng n\u00f3i l\u00ean \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u1ea5t c\u1ea3. Ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p hay kh\u00f4ng ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-XOuOd4Ok1oLooAxbWwRlVm7QgEb\">C\u00e1 nh\u00e2n b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F22MdtXtDolC3Dx8sVtlbV2FgWb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Hi\u1ec7n nay, c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 th\u1ea5y r\u1ecf vi\u1ec7c b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng r\u1ea5t \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u01b0a chu\u1ed9ng tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng TikTok. C\u00e1c c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng c\u0169ng l\u00e0 nh\u00f3m r\u1ea5t ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 ch\u1ea1y TikTok Ads. \u0110\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t l\u00e0 nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi kinh doanh online, t\u1ef1 t\u1ea1o th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n ho\u1eb7c b\u00e1n s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m th\u1eddi trang, m\u1ef9 ph\u1ea9m, \u0111\u1ed3 \u0103n v\u1eb7t&#8230;<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Nj8wdoPgJox2kuxHbrXl0BZLgGc\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-GWrbdO5yDo12luxsL5elS01egbb\">B\u1ea3ng gi\u00e1 d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o TikTok Ads<\/h2>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-BreydZIIvodyaAxK7DwlS8EJgxO\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;62c52792-6600-482b-9377-582bee27294c&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:1963,&quot;width&quot;:3750,&quot;currHeight&quot;:1963,&quot;currWidth&quot;:3750,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:1963,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:3750,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FKKOhbcWEjovRtVxhLR7lGk7mgbd%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;KKOhbcWEjovRtVxhLR7lGk7mgbd&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:2618890,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_3902\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-3902\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-3902\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/7.png\" alt=\"B\u1ea3ng gi\u00e1 d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 TikTok Ads c\u1ee7a Lemon\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/7.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/7-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/7-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/7-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/7-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-3902\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">B\u1ea3ng gi\u00e1 d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 TikTok Ads c\u1ee7a Lemon<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-WOFQdVOW0ov7DFxcU77liRYogtb\">Quy tr\u00ecnh tri\u1ec3n khai d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 TikTok Ads<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-REKQdsLfXo4xxhxSIPXlzoXJguc\">\u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 <strong>quy tr\u00ecnh tri\u1ec3n khai d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 TikTok Ads<\/strong> \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c chia th\u00e0nh 3 giai \u0111o\u1ea1n theo 3 th\u00e1ng:<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\" old-record-id-Way9dnzeuoGv9oxWjV6lmT2Wghc\" data-type=\"divider\">Giai \u0111o\u1ea1n 1 &#8211; Th\u00e1ng th\u1ee9 1<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AIcTduYiEolo8jxYEB0lwXB7ghc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>T\u01b0 v\u1ea5n ph\u00e2n t\u00edch v\u00e0 \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng kinh doanh c\u1ee7a kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean s\u00e0n Shopee, t\u1eeb \u0111\u00f3 x\u00e1c \u0111\u1ecbnh c\u00e1c v\u1ea5n \u0111\u1ec1 c\u1ea7n c\u1ea3i thi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ec3 ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n:<\/strong><\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ThRfdFuoDoRXiTx5iG6lOofhgFc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>T\u0103ng kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u00ecm th\u1ea5y khi ng\u01b0\u1eddi mua search c\u00e1c t\u1eeb kh\u00f3a li\u00ean quan b\u1eb1ng c\u00e1ch thay \u0111\u1ed5i l\u1ea1i t\u00ean v\u00e0 m\u00f4 t\u1ea3 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X4xudqMQVotF9Xxh3CFlLYvRg2c\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>H\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf l\u1ea1i \u0111\u1ec3 t\u0103ng c\u01a1 h\u1ed9i click xem v\u00e0 mua h\u00e0ng trong trang k\u1ebft qu\u1ea3 t\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GZlAdIMclo2LvBxc8E1lqk7ugef\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>T\u0103ng m\u1ee9c \u0111\u1ed9 uy t\u00edn\/chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed9 nh\u1eadn di\u1ec7n c\u1ee7a shop b\u1eb1ng c\u00e1ch thay \u0111\u1ed5i di\u1ec7n m\u1ea1o trang ch\u1ee7 c\u1ee7a gian h\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UgXdd9hXAolzoixteB3lrzh1gMe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>C\u00e1c b\u01b0\u1edbc th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n:<\/strong><\/div>\n<ol class=\"list-number1\" start=\"1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BrpKd995wo2OENxjdwDlFVXoglh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div>T\u01b0 v\u1ea5n t\u1ed1i \u01b0u t\u00ean\/m\u00f4 t\u1ea3 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UygJdEuLNoPf9sxoZENlBxXMgif\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">T\u01b0 v\u1ea5n thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf Keyvisual<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h3 class=\" old-record-id-HedQdsJ2KoXLGAxEyyFlZtOGghb\" data-type=\"divider\">Giai \u0111o\u1ea1n 2 &#8211; Th\u00e1ng th\u1ee9 2<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ulfld6zDEo4gxgxE9WslGr2IgE0\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>M\u1edf r\u1ed9ng l\u01b0u l\u01b0\u1ee3ng truy c\u1eadp v\u00e0 c\u1ea3i thi\u1ec7n hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o b\u1eb1ng c\u00e1ch ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p h\u01a1n \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau. Th\u00fac \u0111\u1ea9y quy\u1ebft \u0111\u1ecbnh mua h\u00e0ng b\u1eb1ng c\u00e1c h\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c khuy\u1ebfn m\u00e3i nh\u01b0 qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng, voucher, Flexi Combo,&#8230;<\/strong><\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VzGLdKWj8obMmkxuUVNlp4dHgHc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>T\u0103ng l\u01b0u l\u01b0\u1ee3ng truy c\u1eadp shop<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T80qdjQ2Koro0IxfRtplm0Hxggf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>T\u0103ng t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 truy c\u1eadp trang chi ti\u1ebft s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WhtYdHP4QoFyEQxeZdhlcGqHg7d\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>T\u0103ng t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i mua h\u00e0ng<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UPhhdxGlvoreMtxqTAblaqTCgjf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>T\u0103ng s\u1ed1 l\u01b0\u1ee3ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m b\u00e1n<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DRJadZblnoD0cTxHKOYlgblDgi4\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>C\u00e1c b\u01b0\u1edbc th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n:<\/strong><\/div>\n<ol class=\"list-number1\" start=\"1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N94wdlbt9oOYGJxBmzbl0ZKDgHg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div>T\u01b0 v\u1ea5n Commerce Plan<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OrH9dHfQUoqRHtx9v5dlgnkCgdc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div>L\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn Hero SKU ph\u00e2n ph\u1ed1i qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KYB3d2JAuoNFKQxGNBtlcBqggAc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div>L\u1eadp k\u1ebf ho\u1ea1ch ph\u00e2n b\u1ed5 ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-H3J8dzAvVo9XdDxOs9jljvJ2gaf\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp v\u00e0 theo d\u00f5i qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o li\u00ean t\u1ee5c<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h3 class=\" old-record-id-RFOddXNRYol14gxy2sVlvHpkgme\" data-type=\"divider\">Giai \u0111o\u1ea1n 3 &#8211; Th\u00e1ng th\u1ee9 3<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NLaTdVTQAoBcu6xpbBxlIgo5gbh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>\u0110\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o \u0111\u00e3 tri\u1ec3n khai v\u00e0 \u0111o l\u01b0\u1eddng c\u00e1c ch\u1ec9 s\u1ed1 qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o Daily &amp; Campaign Sale, t\u1eeb \u0111\u00f3 \u0111\u01b0a ra c\u00e1c khuy\u1ebfn ngh\u1ecb cho giai \u0111o\u1ea1n ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n ti\u1ebfp theo:<\/strong><\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KpzVdwRFgoHqCNxyjvllT3Rtggc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>B\u00e1o c\u00e1o chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JeehdfQ7roX56ZxQDRQlBVyvgwh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>So s\u00e1nh hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng kinh doanh t\u1eeb khi b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u t\u01b0 v\u1ea5n v\u00e0 sau khi tri\u1ec3n khai<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QCeGdfS9Go8ffnx6uC2lyhaTgdf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>So s\u00e1nh hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 t\u0103ng tr\u01b0\u1edfng tr\u00ean c\u00e1c ch\u1ec9 s\u1ed1 Traffic, %CTR, %CR, ROAS<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YL5jdJYpeo3L3Xxsq2Xlx7WwgPb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>C\u00e1c b\u01b0\u1edbc th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n:<\/strong><\/div>\n<ol class=\"list-number1\" start=\"1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YOSKdCJKao9PGKxZC2kljp4tgXg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div>Report l\u1ea1i GMV c\u1ee7a th\u00e1ng tr\u01b0\u1edbc, c\u00e1c ch\u1ec9 s\u1ed1 v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VwHedC7X4oIt2ExrmmAlSv3agCb\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u0110\u1ec1 xu\u1ea5t c\u1ea3i thi\u1ec7n l\u1ea1i ch\u1ec9 s\u1ed1 ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng kinh doanh so v\u1edbi th\u00e1ng tr\u01b0\u1edbc<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-ZC6LdPNQAo7ObmxuMsElgGjdgMf\" data-type=\"divider\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_3903\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-3903\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-3903\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/8.png\" alt=\"Quy tr\u00ecnh tri\u1ec3n khai d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 TikTok Ads c\u1ee7a Lemon\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/8.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/8-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/8-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/8-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/8-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-3903\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Quy tr\u00ecnh tri\u1ec3n khai d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 TikTok Ads c\u1ee7a Lemon<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T1akdEv1Mo9jIAx91l0lgAOlgOd\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-VzX8dYt5PotLXMxRi7olEjOTggJ\">C\u00e2u h\u1ecfi th\u01b0\u1eddng g\u1eb7p<\/h2>\n<ol class=\"list-number1\" start=\"1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Z7z7d4vMyoi57zx5zgLl1yodg9b\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>Ch\u1ea1y qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o TikTok Ads c\u00f3 c\u1ea7n t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n doanh nghi\u1ec7p kh\u00f4ng?<\/strong><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Qsynd6uMyonEzpxn5yYln2nigIg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u0110\u1ec3 ch\u1ea1y TikTok Ads, b\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n TikTok Business (Doanh nghi\u1ec7p) th\u00f4ng qua TikTok Ads Manager. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 y\u00eau c\u1ea7u b\u1eaft bu\u1ed9c \u0111\u1ec3 thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch, theo d\u00f5i v\u00e0 t\u1ed1i \u01b0u qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o.<\/div>\n<ol class=\"list-number1\" start=\"2\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PuwZdpGPkotEUnx6DgYlGvBog8g\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>C\u1ea7n ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch bao nhi\u00eau \u0111\u1ec3 b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u ch\u1ea1y TikTok Ads?<\/strong><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T4VtdkluJowrdbxG1xWl84W6ggg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch t\u1ed1i thi\u1ec3u l\u00e0 20 USD\/ng\u00e0y cho m\u1ed7i nh\u00f3m qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o (ad group). Tuy nhi\u00ean, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u th\u1eed nghi\u1ec7m v\u1edbi kho\u1ea3ng 300.000 \u2013 500.000 VN\u0110\/ng\u00e0y, t\u00f9y m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch v\u00e0 ng\u00e0nh h\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<ol class=\"list-number1\" start=\"3\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KWu1dnZdjok3foxv0G5lK3sIg0b\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>L\u00e0m sao \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111o l\u01b0\u1eddng hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 c\u1ee7a qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o TikTok Ads?<\/strong><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RBn4d5hlwoN2rixLn8XllEtagJd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">B\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng TikTok Ads Manager \u0111\u1ec3 theo d\u00f5i c\u00e1c ch\u1ec9 s\u1ed1 quan tr\u1ecdng nh\u01b0: CPM (gi\u00e1 1.000 l\u01b0\u1ee3t hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb), CTR (t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 nh\u1ea5p chu\u1ed9t), CPC (chi ph\u00ed cho m\u1ed7i l\u01b0\u1ee3t nh\u1ea5p), Conversion (chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i). \u0110\u1ec3 \u0111o ch\u00ednh x\u00e1c h\u00e0nh vi ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng, n\u00ean c\u00e0i TikTok Pixel ho\u1eb7c li\u00ean k\u1ebft v\u1edbi TikTok Shop. Nh\u1eefng ch\u1ec9 s\u1ed1 n\u00e0y gi\u00fap \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 m\u1ee9c \u0111\u1ed9 ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn, t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c v\u00e0 t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i c\u1ee7a chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-TNDIdVSEuoRpcFxI7N5l6gHYglg\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;d6b1ca3f-bd86-4eb1-a966-f59cb1ad8b45&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:192,&quot;width&quot;:192,&quot;currHeight&quot;:192,&quot;currWidth&quot;:192,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:600,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:600,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:0.32,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FRtf7b7CpYoBGKjx6rqslNeCDghe%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;Rtf7b7CpYoBGKjx6rqslNeCDghe&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:51803,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VVyXdcfDqoRGHTx8ef5lhaCqgKg\"><strong>C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N LEMON DIGITAL<\/strong><\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li><strong><strong>\u0110\u1ecba ch\u1ec9: <\/strong><\/strong>2